{"id":"inwiefern","lemma":"inwiefern","pos":"adv","rank":3377,"glosses":["in what way, how","whether"],"ipa":"/ɪnviːfɛʁn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/40/De-inwiefern.ogg/De-inwiefern.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Inwiefern ist das gut für uns?","en":"How is that good for us?","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Inwiefern hilft mir das?","en":"How does this help me?","words":[null,{"g":"to help","l":"helfen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"}]},{"text":"Inwiefern ist das neue System besser?","en":"How is the new system better?","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"system"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"}]},{"text":"Inwiefern bin ich daran schuld?","en":"How is that my fault?","words":[null,{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"on it, on that"},{"g":"debt"}]},{"text":"Ich sehe nicht recht, inwiefern uns das helfen wird.","en":"I don't quite see how that's going to help us.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"right, right-hand"},null,{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to help"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]}]}